2. ध्वन् cl. 1. P. ध्वनति (perf. दध्वान, दध्वनुर्, Bhaṭṭ.; fut. ध्वनिष्यति, ˚निता Gr.)
to sound, roar, make a noise, echo, reverberate, Kāv. &c.;
to mean, imply, (esp. Pass. ध्वन्यते, it is meant, it is implied) :
Caus. ध्वानयति or ध्वनयति, Dhātup. (aor. अदिध्वनत् or अदध्˚ Gr.), to cause to sound, make resound (cf. ˚नयत् below);
 ध्वनयति, to allude to, hint at, Mṛcch. Comm. Intens. in दन्ध्वन, q.v.
